      "html": "<p>Cetopsis parma Oliveira, Vari &amp; Ferraris, 2001. Family Cetopsidae. Maximum size 170 mm (6.7\") SL. Breeding: unreported.</p><p>Etymology: Cetopsis comes from the Greek cetos, meaning whale, and -opsis, meaning likeness, in reference to the whale-like appearance.</p>"
